{"id":"83660625186c7ee3","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-codomain-fibration.md","title":"余域纤维化","display":"df-codomain-fibration — 余域纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-codomain-fibration","display":"df-codomain-fibration — 余域纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-fibre]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-slice-category]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]"],"source":"Example 1.1.6(ii), §1.3; §10.5, p. 625 (PDF 645); tagged-arrow encoding expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-codomain-fibration"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-codomain-fibration"},{"key":"display","html":"df-codomain-fibration — 余域纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 1.1.6(ii), §1.3; §10.5, p. 625 (PDF 645); tagged-arrow encoding expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-codomain-fibration</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为具有拉回的范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\to I\">\\(d:X\\to I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:Y\\to J\">\\(e:Y\\to J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:Z\\to K\">\\(r:Z\\to K\\)</span> 为基箭头。箭头范畴的箭头带完整记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\)</span>；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e\">\\(d,e\\)</span> 时可简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b):d\\to e\">\\((a,b):d\\to e\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B/I\">\\(\\mathcal B/I\\)</span> 与其箭头标签采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_I,S_I\">\\(T_I,S_I\\)</span> 是下文构造的互逆函子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in O_\\to\n\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(sd,se)\n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad t_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle e,r,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a&#39;a,b&#39;b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{cod}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in O_\\to\n\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(sd,se)\n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad t_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle e,r,a&#39;,b&#39;\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a&#39;a,b&#39;b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&amp;\\coloneqq td,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{cod}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_{\\operatorname{cod}}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,d;e,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_{\\operatorname{cod}}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,d;e,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_I(d)&amp;\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad T_I\\langle d,e,a,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a\\rangle,\\\\\nS_I(d)&amp;\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad S_I\\langle d,e,a\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(T_I,(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I,\\mathcal B/I)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(S_I,\\mathcal B/I,(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I),\\\\\nT_IS_I&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B/I},\n\\qquad S_IT_I=\\operatorname{Id}_{(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_I(d)&amp;\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad T_I\\langle d,e,a,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a\\rangle,\\\\\nS_I(d)&amp;\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad S_I\\langle d,e,a\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(T_I,(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I,\\mathcal B/I)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(S_I,\\mathcal B/I,(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I),\\\\\nT_IS_I&amp;=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B/I},\n\\qquad S_IT_I=\\operatorname{Id}_{(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>单位和复合逐分量保持交换方块，故构成范畴；投影保持这些运算。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:J\\to I\">\\(u:J\\to I\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\to I\">\\(d:X\\to I\\)</span> 取拉回方块，即得笛卡尔提升。</li>\n<li>笛卡尔泛性质应用于一个交换方块的上边，给出拉回介体及其唯一性；反向由拉回的同一泛性质成立。于是恰好拉回方块是余域投影的笛卡尔箭头。</li>\n<li>裸二元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> 不能决定任意交换方块的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,e\">\\(d,e\\)</span>；完整标签保证源靶单值。纤维与切片的箭头标签不同，故用上列明确同构替代旧稿的字面相等。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Example 1.1.6(ii)、§1.3；§10.5, p. 625（PDF 645），本页补齐集合记录及同构公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为具有拉回的范畴；$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]，$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为具有拉回的范畴；$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]，$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为具有拉回的范畴；$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]，$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}$ 采用 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]，$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。$\\mathcal B/I$ 与其箭头标签采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]；$T_I,S_I$ 是下文构造的互逆函子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}$ 采用 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]，$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。$\\mathcal B/I$ 与其箭头标签采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]；$T_I,S_I$ 是下文构造的互逆函子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}$ 采用 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]，$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。$\\mathcal B/I$ 与其箭头标签采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]；$T_I,S_I$ 是下文构造的互逆函子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"e:Y\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"r:Z\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"d,e","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b):d\\to e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B/I","display":false},{"tex":"T_I,S_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\to&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B,\\\\\nM_\\to&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\mid d,e\\in O_\\to\n\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(sd,se)\n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(td,te)\\land ea=bd\\},\\\\\ns_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle&\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad t_\\to\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq e,\\\\\ne_\\to(d)&\\coloneqq\\langle d,d,\\operatorname{id}_{sd},\\operatorname{id}_{td}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\to(\\langle e,r,a',b'\\rangle,\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle d,r,a'a,b'b\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal B^\\to&\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\to,M_\\to,s_\\to,t_\\to,e_\\to,c_\\to\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}_0(d)&\\coloneqq td,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{cod}_1\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\\coloneqq b,\\\\\n\\operatorname{cod}&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{cod}_0,\\operatorname{cod}_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B^\\to)&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{cod},\\mathcal B^\\to,\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Fib}(\\operatorname{cod}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_{\\operatorname{cod}}\\langle d,e,a,b\\rangle\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,d;e,b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_I(d)&\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad T_I\\langle d,e,a,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a\\rangle,\\\\\nS_I(d)&\\coloneqq d,\n\\qquad S_I\\langle d,e,a\\rangle\\coloneqq\\langle d,e,a,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(T_I,(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I,\\mathcal B/I)&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(S_I,\\mathcal B/I,(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I),\\\\\nT_IS_I&=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B/I},\n\\qquad S_IT_I=\\operatorname{Id}_{(\\mathcal B^\\to)_I}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"u:J\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"d,e","display":false}],"bytes":3364,"backlinks":[{"id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"箭头范畴的单位与复合逐分量定义；基范畴单位律、结合律给出其范畴公理，两个分量投影保持这些运算，故 $\\operatorname{dom},\\operatorname{cod}$ 是函子。完整标签与 [[16-df-codomain-fibration]]、[[16-df-display-fibration]] 的编码一致；此构造本身不需要拉回。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-codomain-fibration|df-codomain-fibration — 余域纤维化]]"},{"id":"7d83daba15e3a054","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p=\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\to\\mathcal B$，$\\chi=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B^{\\to}}$，见 [[16-df-codomain-fibration]]。"},{"id":"c777f05b6d404ce4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["25a281534aa42440","fc49efccd7348d66","dacf0503b95c88a9","aa1ce0bab1ae8910","c9801f31ec8ac53f","0cd12b341f6289c0","427be4d627513590"]}